    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53004" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμπη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>caterpillar</i>, <i><span class="en">
